"third parameter indicates the calculation mode: if the mode is 0, WEEKS() "
"returns the maximal possible number of weeks between those days. If the mode "
"is 1, it only returns the number of whole weeks in between."
msgstr ""
"Die Weke() funksie gee terug Die verskil tussen twee datums in Weke.Die "
"derde parameter dui aan Die berekening modus: as Die modus is 0, Weke() gee "
"terug Die maksimum moontlik nommer van Weke tussen daardie dae. as Die modus "
"is 1, dit slegs gee terug Die nommer van volledige Weke in tussen."

