"week and 1 day in between"
msgstr ""
"Weke(\"2002-02-18\"; \"2002-02-26\"; 0) gee terug 1, omdat daar is een week "
"en 1 dag in tussen"

#. i18n: file: functions/datetime.xml:246
#: xml_doc.cpp:510
msgid ""
"WEEKS(\"2002-19-02\"; \"2002-19-02\"; 1) returns 0, because there is not a "
"whole week in between, starting at the first day of the week (monday or "
"sunday, depending on your local settings)"
msgstr ""
"Weke(\"2002-19-02\"; \"2002-19-02\"; 1) gee terug 0, omdat daar is nie 'n "
"volledige week in tussen, beginne na die eerste dag van die week (maandag of "
"sondag, afhangend op jou plaaslike instellings)"

#. i18n: file: functions/datetime.xml:266
#: xml_doc.cpp:518
