#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:96
#: xml_doc.cpp:4446
msgid ""
"The SEARCH() function finds one text string (find_text) within another text "
"string (within_text) and returns the number of the starting point of "
"find_text, from the leftmost character of within_text."
msgstr ""
"Die Soektog() funksie vind een teks string (find_text) binne in nog 'n teks "
"string (within_text) en gee terug Die nommer van Die beginne punt van "
"find_text, van Die mees linkse karakter van within_text."

#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:97
#: xml_doc.cpp:4448
msgid ""
"You can use wildcard characters, question mark (?) and asterisk (*). A "
"question mark matches any single character, an asterisk matches any "
"sequences of characters."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan gebruik willekeurige karakter karakters, vraag merk (?) en asterisk "
"(*). 'n vraag merk ooreenstemmende inskrywings enige enkel karakter, 'n "
"asterisk ooreenstemmende inskrywings enige herhalings van karakters."

#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:98
#: xml_doc.cpp:4450
msgid ""
"Parameter start_num specifies the character at which to start the search. "
"The first character is character number 1. If start_num is omitted, it is "
"assumed to be 1. SEARCH does not distinguish between uppercase and lowercase "
"letters."
msgstr ""
"Parameter start_num spesifiseer die karakter na wat na begin die soektog. "
"die eerste karakter is karakter nommer 1. As start_num is weggelaat, dit is "
"aangeneem na wees 1. soektog doen nie onderskei tussen hoofletters en "
"kleinletters letters."

#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:99
#: xml_doc.cpp:4452
msgid "SEARCH(find_text;within_text;start_num)"
msgstr "Soektog(find_text;within_text;start_num)"

#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:100
#: xml_doc.cpp:4454
msgid "SEARCH(\"e\";\"Statements\";6) returns 7"
msgstr "Soektog(\"e\";\"Stellings\";6) gee terug 7"

#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:101
#: xml_doc.cpp:4456
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "SEARCH(\"e\";\"Statements\";6) returns 7"
msgid "SEARCH(\"margin\";\"Profit Margin\") returns 8"
msgstr "Soektog(\"e\";\"Stellings\";6) gee terug 7"

#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:114
#: xml_doc.cpp:4460
msgid ""
"The T() function returns the text referred to by value. If value is, or "
"refers to, text then T returns value. If value does not refer to text then T "
"returns empty text."
msgstr ""
"Die T() funksie gee terug Die teks verwys na deur waarde. As waarde is, of "
"verwys na, teks dan word T gee terug waarde. As waarde doen nie verwys na "
"teks dan word T gee terug leeg teks."

